* SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-S-2.0
* BFR380F model: rough Gummel-Poon fit of the public datasheet (hFE 120, fT 14 GHz, Ccb 0.5 pF), not the vendor model
* Discrete burst-mode laser driver, 5 V laser rail, BFR380F current steering
.param ibias=30m imod=30m ui=803.75p
.model bfr NPN(IS=2e-15 BF=120 NF=1 VAF=30 IKF=0.15 RB=4 RE=0.4 RC=2 CJE=1.2p VJE=0.8 MJE=0.4 CJC=0.5p VJC=0.6 MJC=0.35 TF=9p TR=1n XTF=2 ITF=0.1)
.subckt q c b e
Lb b bi 0.4n
Le e ei 0.3n
Lc c ci 0.4n
Q1 ci bi ei bfr
.ends
.model las D(IS=1e-18 N=2 RS=4 CJO=2p)
V5 v5 0 5
V33 v33 0 3.3
* BOSA: laser anode on +5V_LD through the lead, cathode lead to the driver
Lla v5 la 2n
Dl la lk las
Llk lk ldk 2n
Rsn ldk sn 22
Csn sn v5 22p
* modulation pair, data AC-coupled from the GTS lane (+-200 mV per side), bases biased at 2.3 V through the 50 ohm terminations
